

translate es strings:

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "March out"
    new "En marcha"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "We are to form ranks and to head out of the city. Our path lies across {i}the Valley of Death{/i}."
    new "Debemos formar filas y salir de la ciudad. Nuestro camino es a través del {i}Valle de la Muerte{/i}."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "Defeat the Demorai ambush"
    new "Derrota la emboscada demorai"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "Just as we've been taught, the Demorai have set up a trap for us as we were navigating the Valley of Death. Time to put our training to the {i}real{/i} test."
    new "Tal y como nos han enseñado, los demorai nos han tendido una trampa mientras pasábamos por el Valle de la Muerte. Es hora de poner a prueba nuestro entrenamiento {i}real{/i}."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "March on"
    new "Sigue adelante"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "We have claimed victory in our first real battle against the Demorai. I do realize we'd likely be crushed if it wasn't for First Officer Borras at our side, but all the training sessions vanish compared to what {i}real combat{/i} feels like."
    new "Hemos salido victoriosos de nuestra primera batalla real contra los Demorai. Me doy cuenta de que probablemente nos habrían aplastado si no fuera por el Primer Oficial Borras a nuestro lado, pero todas las sesiones de entrenamiento se desvanecen comparadas con lo que se siente en {i}combate real{/i}."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "Defeat the scorpion monster!"
    new "¡Derrota al monstruo escorpión!"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "We have walked into a horrifying monster. A gigantic scorpion that seemed to have... somehow inhabited a woman's body? It had burned First Officer Borras with a single spit of acidic substance. We are not prepared..."
    new "Nos hemos topado con un monstruo horripilante. Un gigantesco escorpión que parecía haber... somehow inhabited a woman's body? habitado de algún modo el cuerpo de una mujer? Había quemado al Primer Oficial Borras con un solo escupitajo de sustancia ácida. No estamos preparados..."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "Get to the abandoned fort"
    new "Llega al fuerte abandonado"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "We are now past the Valley of Death. Word is, it is going to take us more than a week to get to our objective. Having seen what we had seen, I really want this to be over, {i}soon.{/i}"
    new "Ya hemos pasado el Valle de la Muerte. Se dice que tardaremos más de una semana en llegar a nuestro objetivo. Habiendo visto lo que hemos visto, realmente quiero que esto termine, {i}pronto.{/i}"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "Stand guard as mages open the seal"
    new "Haz guardia mientras las magas abren el sello"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "At the deep cave beneath the deserted fort, we have found what seems to be a magically-sealed door. Captain Duprey ordered some of our mages to unlock it. There's tension in the air. Something's off..."
    new "En la profunda cueva bajo el fuerte desierto, hemos encontrado lo que parece ser una puerta sellada mágicamente. El capitán Duprey ordenó a algunas de nuestras magas que la desbloquearan. Hay tensión en el aire. Algo anda mal..."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "Survive the Demorai onslaught"
    new "Sobrevive al ataque de los demorai"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "The moment we have breached the seal, the fort was attacked by Demorai forces. We must come out of this alive!"
    new "En el momento en que hemos roto el sello, el fuerte fue atacado por las fuerzas demorai. ¡Debemos salir vivos de esto!"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "Examine the chamber"
    new "Examina la recámara"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "Me and Markus have survived the battle by locking ourselves inside the chamber the mages have unlocked. Duprey, Kiara, countless other scouts died before our very eyes. We must find a way out. What is that eerie sound? It sounds like a heartbeat, but a little off-tempo..."
    new "Markus y yo hemos sobrevivido a la batalla encerrándonos en la recámara que las magas han desbloqueado. Duprey, Kiara, incontables exploradores murieron ante nuestros ojos. Debemos encontrar una salida. ¿Qué es ese extraño sonido? Suena como un latido, pero un poco fuera de ritmo..."
    
    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:14
    old "The Dark Passenger"
    new "El pasajero oscuro"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:15
    old "Our training was interrupted by what Captain Duprey called a top-secret mission to accomplish. We are to retrieve a relic of sorts from a fort way down south. It doesn't really sound scary, but I've got a bad feeling about it. Most of us do."
    new "Nuestro entrenamiento fue interrumpido por lo que el capitán Duprey llamó una misión de alto secreto a cumplir. Debemos recuperar una especie de reliquia de un fuerte en el sur. En realidad no suena aterrador, pero tengo un mal presentimiento. La mayoría de nosotros lo tenemos."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:76
    old "Scouts playing cards"
    new "Exploradores jugando a las cartas"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:89
    old "Cave entrance"
    new "Entrada a la cueva"

